<article class="about-card"><p class="eyebrow">THE APPLICATION</p><h2>Tasks for Today Management System</h2><p>This system helps keep school and everyday tasks visible, with a focused dashboard for tasks scheduled today and a complete list for the rest of the schedule.</p><div class="about-divider"></div><div class="about-details"><div><span>Developer</span><strong>Nadine Carino</strong></div><div><span>Built with</span><strong>CodeIgniter 4 · PHP · MySQL</strong></div></div><p class="about-note">The application follows the Model-View-Controller pattern. Models retrieve records from the database, controllers prepare page data, and views render the interface. The welcome page uses date-based filtering to show only tasks scheduled for the current server date.</p></article>
